GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_Intro::
    .string "WHITNEY: Welcome! I heard about\n"
    .string "your trip from KANTO.\p"
    .string "My POKEMON and I love a good\n"
    .string "battle. Let us see your team!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_Defeat::
    .string "No! My team tried so hard!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_Upset::
    .string "WHITNEY: I... I need a moment.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_Badge::
    .string "WHITNEY: Sorry about that.\n"
    .string "You won fair and square.\p"
    .string "Here is the PLAINBADGE!\n"
    .string "Your third JOHTO GYM BADGE.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_TM::
    .string "TM45 teaches ATTRACT.\n"
    .string "Timing can turn a battle around.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_After::
    .string "WHITNEY: Keep getting stronger.\n"
    .string "I will work hard with my team!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_NotReady::
    .string "WHITNEY: Visit our RADIO TOWER\n"
    .string "after earning BUGSY's BADGE.\p"
    .string "They are expecting ELM's\n"
    .string "researcher. Then let us battle!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_BagFull::
    .string "Your BADGE is yours already.\n"
    .string "Make room and collect the TM.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_AssistantBefore::
    .string "WHITNEY loves her team.\n"
    .string "Get ready for a tough battle.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_AssistantEncourage::
    .string "She gets upset when she loses.\n"
    .string "She will be fine in a moment.\p"
    .string "Go speak to her again.\n"
    .string "You earned that BADGE.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_AssistantAfter::
    .string "Good luck with your next GYM!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_VictoriaIntro::
    .string "A cute face can hide real power!$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_VictoriaDefeat::
    .string "You looked past appearances.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_VictoriaAfter::
    .string "WHITNEY's MILTANK is strong.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaIntro::
    .string "Can you handle my POKEMON?$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaDefeat::
    .string "That was a fair battle.$"

GoldenrodCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaAfter::
    .string "Every team has its own rhythm.$"

